1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:55,400
Such abundant spiritual energy !

25
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:56,920
This cave is extraordinary.

26
00:01:58,040 --> 00:02:01,120
The Divine Path is the treasure of our War God Shrine.

27
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:05,000
It can greatly increase a cultivator's success rate in forming a Nascent Soul.

28
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,320
The original Divine Path

29
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:09,280
was stolen by a high rank cultivation country long ago.

30
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,680
The Divine Path is extremely profound

31
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,360
and almost impossible to memorize

32
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,120
or write down.

33
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:21,200
But Founder Chen Chong, relied on his memory back then

34
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:24,040
to forcibly engrave the Divine Path onto this stone tablet

35
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,360
and died of exhaustion by doing it.

36
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:36,040
Disciple Chen Chong is engraving by memory.

37
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:40,680
Future cultivators must be extremely cautious.

38
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,800
How can a few thousand characters be hard to write down ?

39
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:47,080
The Divine Path is unfathomable.

40
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,160
See for yourself.

41
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,680
As long as it helps me form my Nascent Soul,

42
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,280
it's worth it.

43
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,960
What's happening !?

44
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:11,960
The Divine Path really can't be memorized !

45
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:16,200
No, it's a restriction that prevents memorization.

46
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:19,360
That's why it's possible to understand but not memorize.

47
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,640
Founder Chen Chong actually managed to memorize it by force

48
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,800
and write it down.

49
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,680
His perseverance was truly astonishing.

50
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,920
The fiend is in trouble !

51
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:31,160
Isn't this a great opportunity to finish him off ?

52
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,960
I can only use this once !

53
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,160
Fellow Corpse Sect disciples,

54
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,040
come save me !

55
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:45,240
Master,

56
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:49,560
Zhao Chuanliang\NBurning Fire Alliance's Corpse Sect Leader\NEarly stage Nascent Soul

57
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,920
please give me 10 more days.

58
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:50,280
I will definitely bring Xu Liguo back !

59
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:54,600
Chen Bai\NTian Gang country's Corpse Sect Leader\NEarly stage Soul Formation

60
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:56,280
If I give you more time, I'm the one that will have to explain them.

61
00:03:56,840 --> 00:04:00,200
Xu Liguo is a disciple of the Tian Gang Sect

62
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:02,120
the leader of the country of Tian Gang.

63
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:04,680
What am I going to tell them ?

64
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,400
Master,

65
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,920
Xu Liguo sent a distress signal 2 days ago.

66
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,760
We have already located him.

67
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,720
He was captured by a War God Shrine disciple named Ma Liang.

68
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,040
Just give me some time

69
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,320
and I will bring him back !

70
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,080
For the sake of our relation,

71
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,760
I'll give you 10 days.

72
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:26,120
But if you don't have him in 10 days,

73
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:29,400
don't blame me for being ruthless.

74
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,360
The soul lamp is still lit,

75
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,080
it's not too late.

76
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:45,280
Corpse Sect disciples, heed my order !

77
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,120
Ma Liang of the War God Shrine attacked one of us

78
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,760
and extracted the soul of our disciple !

79
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:51,680
It's a crime !

80
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,480
All Core Formation disciples and above

81
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,360
will follow me to the Burning Fire Alliance

82
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,720
to seek justice !

83
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,320
Understood !

84
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,800
The Divine Path...

85
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,440
So this is the Divine Path...

86
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:41,800
Create an avatar to cultivate simultaneously with the main body

87
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:44,200
and merge the two bodies to form a Nascent Soul.

88
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,680
Of course it would increase the success chance.

89
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:50,560
But I don't even have enough artifacts and pills to cultivate my main body.

90
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,840
How could I possibly cultivate an avatar ?

91
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:55,440
I probably can't follow that path.

92
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:12,280
Chong

93
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,440
Founder Chen Chong,

94
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,440
esteemed Ancestors of the War God Shrine,

95
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:22,600
thank you for your guidance and kindness.

96
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,720
My matters with the War God Shrine are settled.

97
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,240
Next up is...

98
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:39,840
Senior.

99
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:43,160
If you took more time to come out,

100
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:45,200
I would've come in to find you.

101
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,840
I pray to heaven and earth !

102
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,160
Please come and find me...

103
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:02,320
If they don't come now,

104
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:05,520
I'll never escape these two devils !

105
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,000
What are you doing ?

106
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,240
N-Nothing, nothing !

107
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:14,000
I was praying for Master's long life.

108
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,320
They're really here.

109
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:59,560
My saviors ! You've finally come to save me !

110
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,840
Ma Liang,

111
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,400
do you know what crime you commited ?

112
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:05,320
I don't.

113
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:09,280
Of course you don't !

114
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,880
Corpse Sect...

115
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:31,120
You half-human half-ghost freaks,

116
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:32,960
what are you here for ?

117
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:38,800
Senior, Ma Liang killed a disciple of the Corpse Sect

118
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:41,520
and extracted the soul of Xu Liguo.

119
00:08:42,040 --> 00:08:44,440
I will now take Ma Liang away

120
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,520
to punish him.

121
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,120
Did you really do it ?

122
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,200
They're framing me.

123
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,600
It's bullshit !

124
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,720
You're the one framing me !

125
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,600
You're the one bullshitting !

126
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,400
Then let us pass.

127
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:59,480
I'm in a hurry.

128
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,400
Senior's cultivation is profound

129
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:12,440
but making an enemy of the Corpse Sect

130
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:14,120
is not wise.

131
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:16,840
The Corpse Sect is the largest sect in the Burning Fire Alliance !

132
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:19,800
There are 8 Nascent Soul cultivators here today.

133
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,720
Think carefully.

134
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:24,880
Are you sure you want to protect this brat ?

135
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:28,160
Are you threatening me ?

136
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:30,680
Scram !

137
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:34,080
I don't feel like killing today.

138
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,680
Arrogant !

139
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:56,960
Underworld Mystic Ice Formation !

140
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,280
Fall !

141
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,280
They're doing it !

142
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:05,680
You little fiend, you'll finally be punished !

143
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,960
Grandpa Xu is going to be free !

144
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:23,120
I have some ties with your sect.

145
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:26,760
I originally didn't want to offend the Corpse Sect

146
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,160
but...

147
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:31,600
I, the Eight Extremes Devil Lord, haven't killed for a long time...

148
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,200
A few Early stage Nascent Soul cultivators

149
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:37,960
dare to act recklessly before me !?

150
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,200
A Soul Formation cultivator !

151
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:51,520
Quick, activate the teleportation formation !

152
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:13,480
This...

153
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:15,560
is the power of Soul Formation...

154
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:17,120
Now scram.

155
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:20,880
Nascent Soul brats, I won't kill you

156
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,600
to give some face to the Corpse Sect.

157
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,240
Ma Liang !

158
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,520
Impossible ! Impossible !

159
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:36,280
How could this have happened ?

160
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:38,920
You little fiend !

161
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,840
No, Master !

162
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,080
Let me explain.

163
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:49,560
I was momentarily possessed.

164
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:53,320
It was my fault, I'm terribly sorry...

165
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:55,960
What other methods do you have to contact the Corpse Sect ?

166
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,520
Use them all now.

167
00:11:58,400 --> 00:12:00,480
He actually knew all along...

168
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,280
No way...

169
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:04,880
He let me do it on purpose !

170
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:13,880
Little guy,

171
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,840
this is the second time I've helped you.

172
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:21,040
No matter what misunderstanding we have, we're even now.

173
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:24,680
I advise you stay put now.

174
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,960
You cannot escape

175
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:28,920
before me.

176
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:32,120
Junior wouldn't dare.

177
00:12:33,800 --> 00:12:36,480
This kid deliberately lured the Corpse Sect here

178
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:39,480
to use me to eliminate them

179
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,760
or to try to escape in the chaos.

180
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:44,040
He's bold

181
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:45,320
and very cunning.

182
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:48,080
He has good potential for a demonic cultivation.

183
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:51,640
If I could take him as a disciple...

184
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:54,560
Too bad...

185
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:58,160
I can't let him return alive from that place.

186
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:07,360
Chaotic Broken Stars\NSea of Devils

187
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:12,520
This is the Chaotic Broken Stars.

188
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,160
To enter the place we're going to

189
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:20,600
we need to use this ancient teleportation formation.

190
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:23,560
We found this place with some friends

191
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:25,880
after looking through ancient records.

192
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:28,520
It nearly took 1000 years.

193
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,480
The Chaotic Broken Stars

194
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:35,040
is already such a weird place.

195
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,880
Where does the formation lead to ?

196
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:45,520
It's a passage connected to the corpse of an Ancient God.

197
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:47,560
An Ancient God ?

198
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:51,560
They're beings from ancient times comparable to Ancient Immortals.

199
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:55,560
Their power reached an unimaginable level.

200
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:57,440
Gun Lan\NAncient Emperor\NEarly stage Soul Formation

201
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:59,880
It's normal for a Core Formation brat to be unaware.

202
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:05,280
This person, Ancient Emperor, looks righteous

203
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:07,560
but has actually slaughtered countless cities.

204
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:10,360
He's a famous Devil Lord of the Sea of Devils.

205
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,360
Ancient Emperor,

206
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:38,280
this Junior is crucial for passing the third trial.

207
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,800
Don't act recklessly.

208
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:40,360
Oh ?

209
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,240
Are you sure ?

210
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:44,480
I also want to know

211
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:48,520
why you're bringing a Core Formation brat to the Land of the Ancient God.

212
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,800
What's the meaning of this farce ?

213
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:53,320
Six Desires Devil Lord,

214
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:56,000
one of the 7 Devil Lords of the inner Sea of Devils.

215
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:59,320
He can manipulate people's minds with desires

216
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:00,280
Six Desires Devil Lord\NXuan Tian Sect Leader\NMiddle stage Soul Formation

217
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:02,640
and has refined countless living puppets.

218
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,240
He knows the Death Spell.

219
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:09,640
Little brat,

220
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:12,920
if you can really help us in the third trial,

221
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:16,960
I wouldn't mind keeping you by my side forever.

222
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,760
Thank you Senior for your kindness.

223
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,960
Only Hunchback Meng is missing.

224
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:28,640
He was being pursued by the Giant Demon Clan. I wonder if he died.

225
00:15:30,160 --> 00:15:31,880
Even if I were to die,

226
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:34,440
I would've dragged the Giant Demon Clan down with me !

227
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:51,320
You said this little brat knows the Death Spell ?

228
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:57,680
Meng Qingfan\NHunchback Meng\NPoison Devil City Lord\NMiddle stage Soul Formation

229
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:59,160
Good ! Very good !

230
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:01,520
I wonder what effect it would have

231
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:03,680
if Li Tian devoured him...

232
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:07,560
It seems most of the Devil Lords of the Sea of Devils have come to this trip.

233
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,120
Everyone is here,

234
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,400
let's begin.

235
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:16,480
Take out your top-quality spirit stones.

236
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:20,080
Top-quality spirit stones ?

237
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:24,800
Top-quality spirit stones are very rare on planet Suzaku.

238
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:29,560
It's no wonder a Core Formation brat like you never saw one before.

239
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:31,120
As agreed,

240
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:33,560
I will provide 4 spirit stones this time.

241
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,320
Damn formation,

242
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:39,200
for devouring my 4 top-quality spirit stones.

243
00:17:18,300 --> 00:19:40,360
It might not be clear why the Corpse Sect would go to such lengths to save Xu Liguo. Xu Liguo comes from a rank 4 country and belonged to the sect that controls that country. He had lost his body so his sect bought a new body for him through the Corpse Sect. Since he should've possessed the body by now, the customer (Xu Liguo's sect) is asking for what they paid for. The desperate attack of the Corpse Sect is just a tentative to not lose face and keep its reputation.\N\NThe Six Desires Devil Lord is named after the six desires and seven emotions found in The Book of Rites and The Spring and Autumn Annals (ancient chinese texts). There are multiple other variations of these two concept but I'll focus on what's used in Renegade Immortal.\N\NThe six desires are lust, greed, vanity, pleasant sounds, having a good life / death, sensual pleasures (pleasures related to the 5 senses: hearing / touch / sight / smell / taste).\N\NThe seven emotions are joy, anger, sorrow, fear, love, hatred and affection.\N\NIn Renegade Immortal, both the six desires and seven emotions are used interchangeably but will always be named "six desires" which makes it a total of 13 theorical "six desires". For some reason, the first six emotions (excluding affection) are the main "six desires". I don't know why, I hope you're not confused.\N\NIt will make sense later why cultivators at Soul Formation are so different from cultivators below that.

244
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:53,720
Count the specks of time

245
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:53,720
floating down gently.

246
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:59,960
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

247
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:07,480
Forever lock away the scars

248
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:07,480
of this mortal life.

249
00:18:07,740 --> 00:18:14,000
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

250
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:21,720
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

251
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:21,720
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

252
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:28,880
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

253
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:28,880
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

254
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:31,400
I will ask the heavens who exactly

255
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:36,160
sliced open this world

256
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:36,160
to let the rain fall in.

257
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:38,160
I will refine the world

258
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:40,680
